{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil","id":1529852,"title":"Modifying the Vigil","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-02T05:48:09-08:00","id":1529852,"title":"Modifying the Vigil","content":"So, in my game The Vigil start off as a Mental thing, that Mage sight of Mind Arcana can reveal a Buring Green Flame within the Hunter Mind, when Hunter join a Compact, the Vigil affect the Soul, which change The Hunter Aura, People with Aura sight, or Mage with Death or Spirit Arcana can see The Buring Gren Vigil within The Hunter Soul, and the Burning Green Aura around The Huntet, when Hunter join a Conspiracy and get Endowment, The Vigil green Flame, burn The Hunter entire being, Mage sight of any Arcana can see Hunter true form, as a Humanoid cover in Green Flame, as Hunter get more and more Endowment, their Physical, Mental, and Social start to change, their form becoming more monsterous, their mind becoming more detach from humanity, and their Social life start to be more people in the Conspiracy, and less about the Mortal that they use to care about. I also make Endowment act as Supernatural Tolerance trait, so Hunter can have only 10 Endowment, and all Endowment are permenant now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T18:36:16-08:00","id":1529875,"title":"","content":"Is there a rationale for joining a compact having any effect at all, considering compacts are typically just coordinated groups of hunters? If so, it might make sense (depending on the rationale) to place the Social changes at that point.<br /> <br /> I'm somewhat curious as to why this is framed as a progression considering that membership in a compact does not usually lead to membership in a conspiracy and the thing the Vigil represents tends to come at monstrosity from the human angle rather than the supernatural angle \u2014 their whole deal is being practical underdogs who rely on teamwork and human connections to beat back the darkness, so what benefit is there to making Endowments both related to the Vigil and progressively mutative?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T19:38:00-08:00","id":1529877,"title":"","content":"So...then what is the vigil?<br /> <br /> Normaly is it's an idea, but is the vigil humanites strength coming to furition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","name":"Cross-a-way","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27385_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T22:03:09-08:00","id":1529883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil?p=1529875#post1529875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a rationale for joining a compact having any effect at all, considering compacts are typically just coordinated groups of hunters? If so, it might make sense (depending on the rationale) to place the Social changes at that point.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can change out Code for Compact Code, and Compact kind of have their own social community, and when Multiple Hunter gather together for long period, and start to shrare their view, the incresing buring of the Vigil in Hunter Mind spread to their Soul. At least in my game, the mind is connected to the Soul, and the Vigil first burn the Mind, then the Soul, then the Body.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil?p=1529875#post1529875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm somewhat curious as to why this is framed as a progression considering that membership in a compact does not usually lead to membership in a conspiracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not a full progression, since you can be in a Conspiracy without having the Vigil buring your Body, the Vigil only start to burn and change your body, when you get Endowment. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil?p=1529875#post1529875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so what benefit is there to making Endowments both related to the Vigil and progressively mutative?</div> </div> </div> </div>I make Endowment progessively mutative to make the Compact have some advantage, and to make it's a Supernatural Tolerance, and making Crossover game with Hunter easier, since Tier 2 and 3 Hunter aren't entierly Human.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T22:12:20-08:00","id":1529885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cross-a-way</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil?p=1529877#post1529877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So...then what is the vigil?<br /> <br /> Normaly is it's an idea, but is the vigil humanites strength coming to furition?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Vigil is a thing only Human can have, The Vigil is a Supernatural respond to the Supernatural, it's protect the Human mind from the Horror of the Supernatual, but it's also distort the Human who have it, The Vigil first burn their Mind, but as the Vigil progress it's start to burn their Soul, and then their Body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T02:58:19-08:00","id":1529889,"title":"","content":"Seems a bit of a disadvantage to have a really easy way to determine if someone is a hunter or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T03:03:46-08:00","id":1529890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil?p=1529889#post1529889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems a bit of a disadvantage to have a really easy way to determine if someone is a hunter or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>When hunting Monster that can't see your Aura, it's doesn't matter that much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-05T17:09:56-08:00","id":1530059,"title":"","content":"The Vigil need the Darkness to survive, without the Darkness with Vigil cease to exist, The Vigil burn both the Mind, Soul, and Body of the Hunter, and The Darkness that it's destroy, to survive the Vigil adapt some of the Darkness into it's flame, making it's burn brighter and longer than those who don't, and those who don't often get snuff out by the darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-07T18:53:01-08:00","id":1530235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil?p=1529885#post1529885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Vigil is a thing only Human can have, The Vigil is a Supernatural respond to the Supernatural, it's protect the Human mind from the Horror of the Supernatual, but it's also distort the Human who have it, The Vigil first burn their Mind, but as the Vigil progress it's start to burn their Soul, and then their Body.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I've not finished the book, my reading was that the Vigil was a purely mundane phenomenon. Any benefits it gives are from changing the way you think and look at the world, but it's purely mundane and so supernatural senses wouldn't ping 'Vigil'. The Vigilant are not the Imbued, although the Imbued would make a good Conspiracy (I should really work on my Heirs to Gaia idea).<br /> <br /> That's not to say that they wouldn't help. Any kind of mind or aura reading can probably let you deduce a hunter, but it'll still require knowledge of common ways hunters think it feel. Unreliable of course, but better than nothing.<br /> <br /> As for Endowments, they don't really work as supernatural tolerance. At least not universally so. A lot do, like Castigation, some straight up don't, like Advanced Armoury, and for some it's questionable, but Elixir. On the other hand having Endowments designed to do that, or to offer counters to supernatant powers, is definitely a thing that would happen. Probably in a somewhat roundabout way for most of them, but it's certainly feasible for a Conspiracy to just straight up give it as part of their Endowments.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-07T19:07:49-08:00","id":1530237,"title":"","content":"I know Vigil is a purely mundane phenomena, but I use this homebrew for when I have a Crossover Chronicle, so that Hunter wouldn't stick out too much from other Supernatural, and Beast can get benefit from Hunter hunting Family.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-08T04:57:35-08:00","id":1530263,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the info, I also want to know it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28047-lewisdavis","name":"LewisDavis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-08T05:20:53-08:00","id":1530265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LewisDavis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil?p=1530263#post1530263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the info, I also want to know it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Know what?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-08T08:54:39-08:00","id":1530278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yumlum</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1529852-modifying-the-vigil?p=1530237#post1530237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know Vigil is a purely mundane phenomena, but I use this homebrew for when I have a Crossover Chronicle, so that Hunter wouldn't stick out too much from other Supernatural, and Beast can get benefit from Hunter hunting Family.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, so first off, do what you want in your games. I'm not here to tell you what to do.<br /> <br /> But that's the point, Hunters are not supernatural. Out of all the lines Vigil is closest to being an expansion to the core/blue books, the big difference being that hunters are assumed to be a lot more proactive. There are of course exceptions, and I'd personally recommend tying these changes entire to joining the conspiracies that make you a supernatural. I can totally see a Cheiron Group agent or Lucifuge member pinging as actively supernatural, maybe even members of the Malleus Maleficerum or Ascending Ones (especially when using an Elixir), but certainly not anybody below that level.<br /> <br /> Basically the Hunters who Beasts can already kin, plus a few others. This is to me a feature and not a big: supernatural engaging with Hunters is always playing with fire, you're not certain to get burnt but there's a good chance of it. The safest ones may in fact be those who have gone Slasher.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-08T08:59:09-08:00","id":1530281,"title":"","content":"I know what Hunter the Vigil is all about, I just like to hack setting so it fit into a certain type of game, Hunter without being supernatural is hard to crossover with, and I don't need to interpersonal drama of that to be the focus in my game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28270-yumlum","name":"Yumlum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"251"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}